{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1792767602162586636,"compiled_state":{"alias":"luny-minute-nandine","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"2bee37b3c5a3445b0eee4f5e77dfa0d64a9dab37588e26ef50440bdd82db1abe","event_uuid":"473c66d1-5451-436c-b865-424b8e6c8408","position":{"commit_sha":"f8cc970800299c1c164c031ac2d5351d98dce089","position":"1792762907726148598-473c66d1-5451-436c-b865-424b8e6c8408"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"771a02f45e1b5c9e59c1ac878bafbe7ef1f3286c730a18baad4ed38da029dfb8","event_uuid":"63804021-251c-4bca-9aac-a1297acd092d","position":{"commit_sha":"ddcdb1e8a7cbfc32ce8ca82927bba444f3430678","position":"1792762915978696008-63804021-251c-4bca-9aac-a1297acd092d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1792762907726148598,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"63804021-251c-4bca-9aac-a1297acd092d","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"}],"description":"## Observed defect\nThree open comment-sweep leaves — improbable-crimson-hare, nonfat-pernicious-aracari, and orthogonal-shrewd-taruca — carry saved PASS plan-review SSHSIG envelopes signed by the original nava-opcert-prod key. Their claims fail `signature: mismatch; ssh-keygen -Y verify rejected signature (exit 255)`. All 3 remain open and unclaimed.\n\nThe envelopes embed the original public key `ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIB6u+ddQiB4ck/ToORQkQwtehODF4VqLirMIUNFpobZZ`, which is still an unrevoked pin in `.rebar/trusted_environments.yaml`. The same pin file also carries the rotated key `ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIGA6u+J56OuLaR8xsCqyIFZisj/Pke3dkNIfgifykhfi`; a recent certified ticket uses it. An isolated SSHSIG verification of improbable-crimson-hare's unchanged envelope returns `certified` under the historical pin and `mismatch` / exit 255 under the rotated pin.\n\n`src/rebar/_opcert_verify.py::_opcert_trust_root` returns only `_opcert_own_public_keys(tracker)` when the certificate principal equals the current principal. That skips the historical pinned keyring for the same principal. The verifier therefore rejects a valid pre-rotation certificate.\n\nAdjacent finding: MCP `plan_review_status` also returns an output-validation error for these tickets because its declared verdict enum omits `mismatch`; the underlying claim error still exposes the mismatch.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A valid certificate signed by an unrevoked, era-valid historical pinned key verifies after the signer rotates to a second key under the same principal.\n- [ ] A certificate signed by a key outside the applicable trusted era, or with changed payload/signature, still fails.\n- [ ] `plan_review_status` returns a structured mismatch verdict or another accurate structured failure instead of an output-schema error.\n- [ ] Focused tests cover both key eras and the MCP status surface; `make verify` passes before Gerrit review.\n- [ ] Gerrit LLM-Review +1, Verified +1, and zero unresolved comments precede revision-scoped submit.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["opcert","plan-review","comment-remediation"],"ticket_id":"d909-5158-adab-4fe7","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Plan-review verification rejects valid historical pinned key after op-cert key rotation","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["473c66d1-5451-436c-b865-424b8e6c8408","63804021-251c-4bca-9aac-a1297acd092d"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792767602162586636,"uuid":"be0975f9-c3c4-4415-b625-2b11c48e4df3"}